{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"text\": \"认真投入过一回，他暂时少问自己该不该走，也因没再退缩而高兴，怒气和抗拒仍搅着他，方向难定。\",\n      \"key\": \"方向难定\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"text\": \"那种不用时时防备的亲近又让他松了口气，可越觉得它可贵，越清楚眼下离它很远。\",\n      \"key\": \"防备的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2a\",\n      \"text\": \"他一时忘了为何用力，放松下来待了一会儿，也不觉得这会儿放松就是背弃了先前的决定，不急着向自己解释。\",\n      \"key\": \"先前的决定\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"text\": \"松快渐退，他想起自己当初不肯再等，也怀疑刚才那股劲是不是出于真心。\",\n      \"key\": \"松快渐退\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S03-2a\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R11\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"补回认真投入如何让他暂时少问自己该不该走，也保留不再退缩的高兴。怒气和抗拒接到S02-4的失落与自我逼迫，不再用S02-5单独解释这些感受。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R12\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-2\", \"S03-2a\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分并修补\",\n      \"why\": \"保留熟悉亲近带来的安慰和现实距离，也保留短暂放松、忘了用力缘由、不把放松当作背弃决定且不急着解释。改掉“辜负先前的决定”，并由S02-1说明这不是撤回行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R13\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S03-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留松快渐退、当初不肯再等的决定重现及对刚才那股劲的怀疑。删掉与S03-2重复的距离描写，让转折从松快退去直接引出。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c466e6e9-938b-410c-807d-a31c8794356f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134808767782Z", "elapsed_seconds": 955.641, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T14:04:04.413186+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "adea3efd81fafe1db8a16fe492a812fadd73e06deb9bbe065ffb29231470beb5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T134808767782Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "b093d4ad8b7a55525f2908dcf99d248b0a4550c6ee3d1159e60338faaa4eda5c"}}}
